/E (We are committed to providing an inclusive atmosphere where every student can express their creativity and showcase their talents. Our project emphasizes personal connections and storytelling through engineering challenges. By incorporating Guidara's principle of Personalization, we ensure that every team gets its own moment in front of the school, allowing their unique contraptions to shine. Moreover, Carnegie's principle of making others feel important reinforces our goal to celebrate ordinary students, integrating them into the spotlight. This focus on the collective experience enhances school spirit and promotes a sense of belonging, making the egg drop competition a highlight of the academic year.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
